[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13980.71, "timestamp": "03:53:00", "text": "你很快就会看到的。你会想，“什么？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13983.99, "timestamp": "03:53:03", "text": "实际"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13991.99, "timestamp": "03:53:11", "text": "是的，那里有个耶稣主题的油管博主。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13994.229, "timestamp": "03:53:14", "text": "好的，我给你看看。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13996.63, "timestamp": "03:53:16", "text": "那里有一把枪。是的，我关注他。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14000.15, "timestamp": "03:53:20", "text": "跟着他。这里有些 Twitch 相关的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14003.51, "timestamp": "03:53:23", "text": "这是关于 Twitch 的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14005.429, "timestamp": "03:53:25", "text": "我一直都在那里，我当时就在他的直播间里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14007.75, "timestamp": "03:53:27", "text": "他当时正在制作枪支模型，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14018.79, "timestamp": "03:53:38", "text": "对，呵呵，那是他的系列作品之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14029.349, "timestamp": "03:53:49", "text": "耶稣基督。对，就是这个人。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14031.99, "timestamp": "03:53:51", "text": "吉娜。耶稣。加入。我刚才是不是说了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14035.429, "timestamp": "03:53:55", "text": "天才？我的天啊。我是耶稣。加入我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14037.429, "timestamp": "03:53:57", "text": "当我了解动漫、电子游戏时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14039.11, "timestamp": "03:53:59", "text": "以及桌面游戏。是的，就是这样。"}]